            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I resize and compress at the same time?
              </summary>

              <p>
                Yes. Choose your dimensions, target file
                size and output format, then click
                Resize & compress.
              </p>
            </details>


            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I target a specific file size?
              </summary>

              <p>
                Yes. Enter a target such as 40 KB or
                1 MB. The tool automatically adjusts
                JPEG or WebP compression to get as close
                as possible to your target.
              </p>
            </details>


            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I process multiple images?
              </summary>

              <p>
                Yes. You can select multiple supported
                image files and process them together.
              </p>
            </details>


            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I preserve the aspect ratio?
              </summary>

              <p>
                Yes. Keep the aspect-ratio lock enabled
                while changing the width or height.
              </p>
            </details>


            <details>
              <summary>
                Which formats can I export?
              </summary>

              <p>
                You can export your images as JPG, PNG
                or WebP.
              </p>
            </details>

          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>


    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="site-footer">

      <div class="container footer-inner">

        <div>

          <a
            class="brand footer-brand"
            href="/"
          >
            <img
              src="/favicon.png"
              alt=""
              class="brand-icon"
            />

            <span>
              ImageSizeChanger
            </span>
          </a>

          <p>
            Simple image tools for everyone.
          </p>

        </div>


        <div class="footer-links">

          <a href="/#resize">
            Resize
          </a>

          <a href="/#features">
            Features
          </a>

          <a href="/#faq">
            FAQ
          </a>

          <a href="/about">
            About
          </a>

          <a href="/privacy">
            Privacy
          </a>

          <a href="/terms">
            Terms
          </a>

          <a href="/contact">
